[ ] 5. NODES: Created nodes/<your_agent>.py with node functions
[ ] 6. IMPORTS: Imported node functions in workflow.py
[ ] 7. WORKFLOW: Added nodes with workflow.add_node() in create_workflow()
[ ] 8. WORKFLOW: Added edges with workflow.add_edge() or add_conditional_edges()
[ ] 9. WORKFLOW: Updated conditional edges mapping
[ ] 10. STATE: Added agent-specific fields to AgentState (if needed)
[ ] 11. STATE: Updated create_initial_state() (if needed)
